\pard\sb60\sa60\cf0\b0\fs22 Copy and paste the full PL/SQL block below and click Run:\par

\pard\sb60\par
\trowd\trgaph200\trrh1\trpaddl200\trpaddr200\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
