\pard\sa120\qc\cf2\fs28 Database Trigger \f1\endash  \f0 Library Audit System\cf0\fs22\par

\pard\sa600\qc\cf18\i Oracle PL/SQL | Row Level Trigger | Before Trigger | Audit Trail\cf0\i0\par

